<font face="Segoe UI" size="75"></font>

440
00:21:55,660 --> 00:22:03,880
<font face="Segoe UI" size="80"><b>{\an8}dango dango dango dango dango daikazoku</b></font>

441
00:21:55,660 --> 00:22:03,880
<font face="Segoe UI" size="80"><b>Dango, dango, dango, dango, đại gia đình dango.</b></font>

442
00:22:05,130 --> 00:22:10,010
<font face="Segoe UI" size="80"><b>{\an8}yanchana yaki dango yasashii an dango</b></font>

443
00:22:05,130 --> 00:22:10,010
<font face="Segoe UI" size="80"><b>Dango nướng tinh nghịch, dango đậu đỏ dịu dàng,</b></font>

444
00:22:10,010 --> 00:22:14,720
<font face="Segoe UI" size="80"><b>{\an8}yanchana yaki dango yasashii an dango</b></font>

445
00:22:10,010 --> 00:22:14,720
<font face="Segoe UI" size="80"><b>Dango nướng tinh nghịch, dango đậu đỏ dịu dàng,</b></font>

446
